  m_Name: Salt Flat
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: FishMMO.Shared::FishMMO.Shared.Biomes.BiomeTemplate
  DisplayName: Salt Flat
  Description: "A dead lake of salt in a furnace-hot basin \u2014 white polygon crust
    to the horizon, brine eyes red as wine, salt cut into bars and carried up the
    scarp by caravans, mat-dome camps on the black lava rim, and pillars of salt
    that watch the sun"
